WEBVTT

01:36.520 --> 01:39.440
EPISODE 8

01:51.800 --> 01:53.080
Masters.

01:53.160 --> 01:55.840
Our Madam urged us to bring you the books,

01:55.920 --> 01:57.840
lest we hinder your studies.

01:57.920 --> 01:59.760
She also said that academic studies

01:59.840 --> 02:01.120
might be important.

02:01.200 --> 02:03.080
But Mr. Sang,
you just got over a long illness.

02:03.680 --> 02:06.080
Please take care of yourself
and don't rush it.

02:07.520 --> 02:09.120
See? What did I tell you?

02:10.160 --> 02:11.560
Please thank Madam Li for me.

02:14.280 --> 02:16.560
T-this is…?

02:18.600 --> 02:21.040
Sorry, that was a mistake.

02:21.120 --> 02:23.320
- This is not for you.
- Wait.

02:23.400 --> 02:25.600
Luxuriant Dew of the Spring
and Autumn Annals. Volume 17.

02:25.680 --> 02:27.920
All the copies I found
in the Xiangguo Temple book market

02:28.000 --> 02:29.840
were missing the last two pages.

02:30.440 --> 02:31.640
Where did you get this from?

02:31.720 --> 02:33.560
- I…
- Listen, Chunlai.

02:33.640 --> 02:35.960
May I keep it for a few days and return it

02:36.040 --> 02:37.640
after I copy the last two pages?

02:37.720 --> 02:38.960
That's not up to me.

02:39.040 --> 02:41.520
I must go back and ask…

02:42.760 --> 02:43.680
Ask whom?

02:44.360 --> 02:46.040
Our third lady.

02:46.120 --> 02:48.120
Her literary matchmaking failed,

02:48.200 --> 02:49.760
and she gave you a donkey in the end.

02:50.360 --> 02:51.520
And she plays the flute.

02:51.600 --> 02:52.720
Stop gossiping.

02:52.800 --> 02:54.600
I'll tell our madam to punish you.

02:57.240 --> 02:58.160
Please allow me

02:58.240 --> 03:00.040
to ask our third lady for permission.

03:01.240 --> 03:02.800
But…

03:02.880 --> 03:03.720
Wait.

03:07.040 --> 03:09.640
If you know her, please go talk to her.

03:10.480 --> 03:12.760
She holds a grudge against me.

03:12.840 --> 03:14.600
She would kick me out if I went there.

03:14.680 --> 03:16.400
I don't care. I want the book.

03:16.480 --> 03:17.440
Hurry up and go.

03:24.000 --> 03:25.800
Master, what are you…?

03:28.640 --> 03:30.320
I ruined her engagement,

03:30.400 --> 03:32.200
and now I'm asking her for a book.

03:33.000 --> 03:34.320
If I don't get the book,

03:34.400 --> 03:36.480
considering Andao's obsession with books,

03:36.560 --> 03:37.800
I won't hear the end of it.

03:38.560 --> 03:39.560
But I really think

03:39.640 --> 03:41.920
I'll get a good beating if I talk to her.

03:43.200 --> 03:44.320
It's all Master Chai's fault.

03:45.680 --> 03:47.440
Master, I'm truly sorry.

03:50.520 --> 03:51.440
There she is.

03:56.960 --> 03:58.600
Hurry. Shouhua has been waiting.

04:00.720 --> 04:02.720
Slow down. Watch your step.

04:13.760 --> 04:16.040
So well wrapped. What is this?

04:31.880 --> 04:32.880
Yuanming.

04:32.960 --> 04:34.240
It's freezing out here.

04:34.320 --> 04:35.880
Why are you reading outdoors?

04:35.960 --> 04:37.760
Are you expecting someone?

04:38.680 --> 04:39.680
Who would visit me?

04:40.560 --> 04:41.640
It's just that

04:41.720 --> 04:43.680
the room is warm and makes me drowsy.

04:43.760 --> 04:45.360
I feel more awake out here.

04:46.040 --> 04:48.240
Gentlemen, please come in.

04:51.520 --> 04:54.200
Yuanming, why did you return
what we sent you?

04:54.280 --> 04:56.680
Why do you insist
on returning those things?

04:57.520 --> 04:58.560
Don't get us wrong.

04:58.640 --> 05:01.000
Sang Andao is eccentric and peculiar.

05:01.080 --> 05:03.080
He says that receiving gifts for no reason

05:03.760 --> 05:05.760
might damage our luck on the exam.

05:05.840 --> 05:08.440
Besides, we can't
accept rewards without merits.

05:08.520 --> 05:11.120
Are you suspecting me
of bribing you before you even

05:11.200 --> 05:12.120
become officials?

05:12.760 --> 05:14.480
These are just some clothes.

05:14.560 --> 05:16.240
They don't cost much.

05:17.160 --> 05:18.520
You know Yuanming.

05:18.600 --> 05:20.560
He didn't befriend us for material gains.

05:20.640 --> 05:22.640
A pure friendship lasts the longest.

05:23.360 --> 05:24.200
Don't you see?

05:24.280 --> 05:25.840
Although he lives here,

05:25.920 --> 05:28.160
he doesn't take anything
from the Li family.

05:28.240 --> 05:29.400
Mr. Chai knows me the best.

05:29.480 --> 05:31.000
That's my friend.

05:31.600 --> 05:32.720
You, oh you.

05:45.040 --> 05:46.040
Master Du.

05:46.120 --> 05:48.000
Our third lady says

05:48.080 --> 05:50.000
that ambergris comes from the far west.

05:50.080 --> 05:51.760
It's a rare gift from someone.

05:51.840 --> 05:54.800
We even sent it to a shop
to embed it with jade. It's very valuable.

05:55.520 --> 05:57.560
Thankfully, you found and returned it

05:57.640 --> 05:59.000
and saved us from trouble.

05:59.080 --> 06:01.520
We can't repay your noble deed.

06:01.600 --> 06:03.440
We only have a set of ink and inkstone,

06:03.520 --> 06:05.680
which comes in handy for writing.

06:05.760 --> 06:06.960
Please kindly accept it.

06:12.200 --> 06:14.320
Everyone says the ink
made by Pan Gu of Shezhou

06:14.400 --> 06:15.600
is the best.

06:15.680 --> 06:18.120
Very few know that the fancy inks
outside the Xiangguo Temple

06:18.200 --> 06:19.320
are mostly fake.

06:20.640 --> 06:21.520
Look.

06:22.080 --> 06:24.960
It's made
by the Ink Immortal with his trademark.

06:25.040 --> 06:26.680
Right here.

06:26.760 --> 06:28.080
Let me see.

06:30.320 --> 06:31.960
This inkstone also looks fancy.

06:33.840 --> 06:35.160
PLUM BLOSSOMS MINGLED WITH FALLING SNOW

06:44.040 --> 06:45.320
Our third lady also said

06:45.400 --> 06:48.120
it once belonged to our master.

06:48.200 --> 06:50.240
It's a pity to let it lie in dust.

06:50.840 --> 06:52.280
If you do not accept it,

06:52.360 --> 06:55.360
she can only repay you with money.

06:56.080 --> 06:57.040
Accept it.

06:57.120 --> 06:59.360
You found her ambergris,
which is more precious than gold.

06:59.440 --> 07:01.040
It's a token of gratitude.

07:01.120 --> 07:03.400
So, you've earned it. Just accept it.

07:04.440 --> 07:07.280
Then, please thank
your third lady for me, Chunlai.

07:09.280 --> 07:11.360
How did it slip from my hands?

07:12.160 --> 07:14.800
That was a top-quality Dengni inkstone.

07:16.080 --> 07:17.160
What a shame.

07:17.240 --> 07:19.320
Brother, that was such a fine inkstone.

07:19.400 --> 07:20.440
Why were you so careless?

07:20.520 --> 07:22.440
Listen, Yuanming, relax.

07:22.520 --> 07:25.760
I will compensate you with my inkstone
made from Qingzhou Hongsi stone.

07:25.840 --> 07:27.240
Don't bother with this one.

07:29.800 --> 07:31.520
LUXURIANT DEW OF THE SPRING
AND AUTUMN ANNALS

07:32.120 --> 07:33.920
Chunlai, please thank your third lady.

07:39.440 --> 07:41.800
Brother, why are you
pulling a long face again?

07:41.880 --> 07:44.720
Wait. I need to talk to you.

07:53.280 --> 07:54.320
Dig in.

07:58.640 --> 07:59.800
Betting on both sides.

07:59.880 --> 08:01.720
Be careful. You may end up

08:01.800 --> 08:03.400
winning nothing.

08:17.360 --> 08:19.920
Kangning, it's freezing.
Better head back inside.

08:30.440 --> 08:31.800
What's wrong?

08:31.880 --> 08:32.760
You failed?

08:33.360 --> 08:35.520
It was almost done.

08:35.600 --> 08:39.120
But I didn't expect that Mr. Chai

08:39.720 --> 08:41.560
would drop the fine inkstone.

08:41.640 --> 08:43.200
He did?

08:43.280 --> 08:44.720
Yes, he did.

08:46.320 --> 08:47.640
Kangning.

08:47.720 --> 08:49.720
I told you to take action in his absence

08:49.800 --> 08:51.000
to avoid any disturbance.

08:51.600 --> 08:53.200
This person harbors ill intentions.

08:53.280 --> 08:54.640
You've been carving that all night.

08:56.720 --> 08:58.320
He did well.

08:58.400 --> 09:01.400
I won't blame him.
I must thank him, instead.

09:04.760 --> 09:06.000
Thank you.

09:10.320 --> 09:12.040
Plum blossoms mingled with falling snow.

09:12.120 --> 09:14.480
How many flowers bloom upon the trees?

09:14.560 --> 09:16.080
Truly one must drink to the full,

09:16.680 --> 09:18.360
hoping that the like-minded will join.

09:19.640 --> 09:22.600
Well-formed verses showing appreciation.

09:23.280 --> 09:25.160
So much affection.

09:25.240 --> 09:28.640
Li Kangning, you're going
to great lengths for Du Yangxi.

09:30.720 --> 09:32.040
So, Kangning did this…

09:35.720 --> 09:38.720
I see. My mother-in-law fancies him.

09:40.120 --> 09:41.480
Makes sense.

09:41.560 --> 09:45.320
He truly stands out from the rest
with his appearance and talent.

09:45.400 --> 09:46.880
Whoever marries him

09:46.960 --> 09:49.400
may be respected
as the wife of a top scholar one day.

09:49.480 --> 09:50.480
Who wouldn't be tempted?

09:51.640 --> 09:53.760
Brother, actually,
I'm here to persuade you

09:53.840 --> 09:55.240
on your mother's behalf.

09:55.920 --> 09:57.640
If you don't want to get beaten,

09:57.720 --> 09:59.280
hold your tongue.

10:00.560 --> 10:01.480
Auntie promised

10:01.560 --> 10:03.960
not to bring up anyone you dislike again.

10:04.040 --> 10:05.520
It's just that there is a family

10:05.600 --> 10:08.920
that matches the Chai family
with their wealth.

10:09.000 --> 10:12.080
The daughter of that family
is graceful and demure.

10:12.160 --> 10:14.960
And you've grown up together
as childhood sweethearts.

10:15.040 --> 10:17.640
It would be nice if you could get married.

10:17.720 --> 10:19.760
Both your families could prosper.

10:19.840 --> 10:21.880
You know her. It's Liu Baniang.

10:21.960 --> 10:23.200
Who?

10:23.280 --> 10:24.840
You know her.

10:24.920 --> 10:26.240
She's Liu Tang's daughter.

10:26.320 --> 10:28.040
You used to call her "little sister".

10:28.920 --> 10:30.640
- Her?
- That's right.

10:32.800 --> 10:34.960
How did I forget about her?

10:35.040 --> 10:38.800
Speaking of which,
I haven't seen her for two years.

10:38.880 --> 10:40.320
We should totally meet up.

10:40.400 --> 10:42.880
Brother, I'm glad you've come around.

10:42.960 --> 10:45.800
I'll tell Auntie right away
to arrange a meeting for you.

10:46.400 --> 10:48.680
Wait for me.

10:52.280 --> 10:53.320
Li Kangning.

10:53.400 --> 10:55.000
This time, you can't blame me.

10:55.080 --> 10:57.440
Even heaven is working against you.

11:00.200 --> 11:02.760
Who are you? Let go of me.

11:03.760 --> 11:04.720
Who are you?

11:04.800 --> 11:06.960
Let go. Untie me.

11:07.040 --> 11:08.000
Untie me.

11:11.320 --> 11:12.360
You may leave.

11:12.440 --> 11:13.560
- Understood.
- Understood.

11:18.360 --> 11:19.880
You abducted me.

11:19.960 --> 11:21.880
If my wife asks, you must testify for me.

11:21.960 --> 11:23.360
I didn't sneak away.

11:23.440 --> 11:24.960
I told you not to tease him.

11:25.040 --> 11:26.320
Look how you've scared him.

11:26.400 --> 11:29.640
Brother, help. Untie me.

11:29.720 --> 11:30.680
Brother, untie me.

11:31.280 --> 11:33.680
Baniang invited you over
with good intentions.

11:33.760 --> 11:35.920
Who on earth invites guests like this?

11:36.000 --> 11:36.840
I was startled.

11:37.720 --> 11:39.120
Master Fan, please don't be mad.

11:39.200 --> 11:40.480
Chai An told me that

11:40.560 --> 11:42.240
you were confined at home by your wife

11:42.320 --> 11:43.880
to study the account books.

11:43.960 --> 11:45.200
So, that was my last resort.

11:45.280 --> 11:47.720
If your wife asks about it one day,

11:47.800 --> 11:49.160
just blame it on me.

11:49.240 --> 11:50.760
You make it sound so easy.

11:50.840 --> 11:52.040
What if she asks,

11:52.120 --> 11:55.000
"Why would
a single young lady abduct you

11:55.080 --> 11:56.480
and not someone else?

11:56.560 --> 11:57.840
Is there something between you?"

11:57.920 --> 11:59.960
What am I supposed to say?

12:00.040 --> 12:01.000
Tell me.

12:01.080 --> 12:03.280
Brother, let's get to business.

12:03.360 --> 12:07.120
Baniang invited you to ask for a favor.

12:16.120 --> 12:17.000
Thanks to Master Chai,

12:17.600 --> 12:19.240
we found a great physician

12:19.320 --> 12:21.400
who managed to cure my long illness.

12:21.480 --> 12:23.960
I just recovered.
Why are you coughing now?

12:26.320 --> 12:28.920
It's because
I've been copying the book for you.

12:29.000 --> 12:31.360
How much debt
did I owe you from a past life?

12:32.400 --> 12:33.440
Alright, I'll return it.

12:33.520 --> 12:35.160
LUXURIANT DEW OF THE SPRING
AND AUTUMN ANNALS

12:36.120 --> 12:38.200
Fine, return it yourself.

12:38.280 --> 12:40.480
Catch a glimpse of Li Kangning

12:40.560 --> 12:42.560
for the sake
of the enchanting flute sound.

12:43.160 --> 12:45.480
The Fan family invited me over
to paint this afternoon.

12:45.560 --> 12:46.920
I need to do a draft first.

12:48.000 --> 12:49.480
Go away. Leave me alone.

12:49.560 --> 12:50.800
The Fan family?

12:52.040 --> 12:53.960
Maybe it's Li Kangning's excuse
to see you?

12:56.520 --> 12:57.560
Really?

12:57.640 --> 13:00.120
Leshan really loves to be different.

13:00.200 --> 13:01.480
So much fuss over wontons.

13:02.200 --> 13:04.400
Dough made with plum blossoms water.

13:04.480 --> 13:07.040
And the wontons must be cooked
in chicken soup, right?

13:07.120 --> 13:10.000
Mother was jealous
of Madam Liang's tea shop.

13:10.080 --> 13:11.760
With the Winter Solstice approaching,

13:11.840 --> 13:13.440
she thought wontons would sell.

13:13.520 --> 13:15.480
But I think it's too much of a fuss.

13:15.560 --> 13:18.120
Make different fillings
and cook everything in one pot.

13:18.200 --> 13:20.480
I bet Hundred Flavor Wontons
will sell the best.

13:20.560 --> 13:21.800
That would be nice.

13:21.880 --> 13:23.480
But it's not as elegant as plum blossoms.

13:23.560 --> 13:26.240
I'm afraid the scholars next door
won't be impressed.

13:32.360 --> 13:34.760
What? Say it again.

13:34.840 --> 13:36.240
At midday,

13:36.320 --> 13:38.720
Master's servant Fan Jiu
opened the back door

13:38.800 --> 13:41.600
and led a young lady inside.

13:42.200 --> 13:43.360
Well, well.

13:43.440 --> 13:45.240
I've only been out for a moment

13:45.320 --> 13:48.120
and he's been
bringing ladies into the house.

13:48.200 --> 13:50.480
He never learns his lesson.

13:51.200 --> 13:52.600
- Step aside.
- Fuhui.

13:53.200 --> 13:56.040
Kangning. There might be trouble.
Keep an eye on her.

13:56.120 --> 13:57.240
Fuhui.

13:58.960 --> 13:59.840
FAN'S MANSION

13:59.920 --> 14:00.760
Brother.

14:01.360 --> 14:04.160
I'm taking a huge risk by helping you.

14:04.240 --> 14:06.360
I let an unmarried lady into the house.

14:06.440 --> 14:08.840
If my wife finds out,
she will skin me alive.

14:08.920 --> 14:10.840
Liu Baniang is only meeting someone here.

14:10.920 --> 14:12.160
Do you have to be so anxious?

14:12.240 --> 14:14.800
Why here and not at your place?

14:14.880 --> 14:16.120
I am a married man.

14:16.200 --> 14:17.680
She is a single lady.

14:17.760 --> 14:20.040
When did we ever become acquainted?

14:20.120 --> 14:21.120
How do I explain that?

14:22.000 --> 14:23.160
If my wife finds out,

14:23.240 --> 14:25.680
she's going to lose it out of jealousy.

14:25.760 --> 14:27.760
You're not the one who's going to suffer.

14:28.880 --> 14:31.600
The Chai and Liu families
are discussing a marital alliance.

14:31.680 --> 14:32.920
She can't go to my place.

14:33.000 --> 14:34.600
That's why she came here.

14:34.680 --> 14:37.120
Besides, I'm here to defend you.

14:38.240 --> 14:40.480
Masters, the painter has arrived.

14:40.560 --> 14:43.880
I have sent her over
as you instructed, Master Chai.

14:43.960 --> 14:46.160
- Good job. You may leave now.
- Understood.

14:49.440 --> 14:52.600
I hope Liu Baniang
can vent her anger and leave soon.

14:52.680 --> 14:54.480
Don't let my wife run into her.

14:55.720 --> 14:59.000
Brother, I'm afraid I have to
sacrifice you this time.

15:04.680 --> 15:05.600
Stop right there.

15:07.600 --> 15:10.040
You're back, my lady.
Let me inform my master.

15:10.120 --> 15:12.360
No need. I'll find who I'm looking for.

15:12.440 --> 15:13.760
We'll settle this later on.

15:15.400 --> 15:16.840
- My lady.
- Fuhui.

15:16.920 --> 15:17.840
My lady.

15:17.920 --> 15:19.360
Fuhui, slow down.

15:19.440 --> 15:21.320
- My lady, our master is not there.
- Listen to me.

15:22.360 --> 15:23.520
Fuhui.

15:23.600 --> 15:26.320
My lady, our master is not in the study.

15:35.880 --> 15:36.760
Come with me.

15:38.880 --> 15:41.200
Master Chai, what are you doing?

15:41.280 --> 15:42.240
Let go.

15:42.320 --> 15:45.160
Don't you want to know
what kind of person Du Yangxi is?

15:54.000 --> 15:55.440
Please hide in there.

15:57.560 --> 15:59.160
Master Du will be here?

15:59.240 --> 16:00.840
I am an honest man.

16:00.920 --> 16:02.080
Have I ever lied to you?

16:02.160 --> 16:05.640
I'm only trying
to expose someone's true nature.

16:05.720 --> 16:07.200
I will not hurt you.

16:07.280 --> 16:09.000
Besides, we're in the Fan's mansion.

16:10.640 --> 16:13.640
- But--
- Cats hide their claws.

16:13.720 --> 16:17.120
How can you marry someone
without knowing his true colors?

16:17.200 --> 16:19.280
Kangning, I am trying to help you.

16:22.080 --> 16:23.320
Please.

16:50.520 --> 16:51.440
Get up.

16:54.960 --> 16:56.240
Hurry.

16:58.640 --> 17:00.800
My wife is looking for me. Be quiet.

17:05.520 --> 17:08.760
My lady, please be careful.

17:17.240 --> 17:18.440
Lady Liu.

17:18.520 --> 17:20.160
Why did you corner me here?

17:21.360 --> 17:22.920
What exactly do you want?

17:23.000 --> 17:25.240
I want to talk things through with you.

17:26.360 --> 17:28.200
Master Du, you haven't told me

17:28.280 --> 17:29.640
why you turned me down.

17:29.720 --> 17:33.120
I'm a humble man of modest ability
and mediocre talent.

17:33.880 --> 17:35.400
I don't deserve a lady like you.

17:36.560 --> 17:37.600
Nonsense.

17:38.200 --> 17:39.480
I bet you refused to marry me

17:39.560 --> 17:42.680
because you looked down upon my family
for being merchants

17:42.760 --> 17:44.920
and wanted to marry
into a distinguished family

17:45.000 --> 17:46.720
to cling to real power in the court.

17:47.320 --> 17:49.960
Then why are you living
next door to the Li family

17:50.040 --> 17:51.920
and thinking about marrying Li Kangning?

17:53.280 --> 17:55.200
There is no such thing.

17:56.560 --> 17:58.840
As a Juren who came for the imperial exam,

17:58.920 --> 18:00.600
you're living next

18:01.480 --> 18:04.800
to a family with five daughters
without avoiding the ladies.

18:05.440 --> 18:07.040
How dare you deny it?

18:08.040 --> 18:09.320
Lady Liu.

18:09.400 --> 18:10.600
It's my own business,

18:10.680 --> 18:12.120
no matter whether

18:12.880 --> 18:13.920
it's true or not.

18:15.520 --> 18:17.760
If you favor a lady
from a distinguished family

18:17.840 --> 18:19.240
due to your pride and ambition,

18:20.400 --> 18:24.160
then I accept the fact
that we're not meant to be.

18:24.240 --> 18:25.280
And it's fine by me.

18:25.880 --> 18:28.320
But you chose Li Kangning over me.

18:28.400 --> 18:30.520
Then I must ask.

18:30.600 --> 18:31.880
Ask what?

18:31.960 --> 18:36.080
Is it because they are wealthy
or that they offer a huge dowry?

18:43.440 --> 18:47.080
Even if she is pretty,
am I much uglier than her?

18:47.160 --> 18:51.120
Even if she is talented,
do I look dumb to you?

18:51.200 --> 18:52.240
Master Du.

18:52.320 --> 18:53.960
Look closely.

18:54.040 --> 18:55.160
Am I inferior to her?

18:56.720 --> 18:57.880
No.

18:57.960 --> 18:59.280
You are perfect as you are.

18:59.360 --> 19:00.720
But marriage is predestined.

19:00.800 --> 19:01.960
It can't be forced.

19:02.040 --> 19:03.760
I don't care if you turn me down.

19:03.840 --> 19:06.240
But you're buttering them up
while rejecting me.

19:06.840 --> 19:09.840
You're clearly humiliating me.

19:10.440 --> 19:13.320
Everyone in Bianjing will think
Li Kangning is better than me.

19:13.400 --> 19:15.680
Even a Juren who has not
passed the imperial exam

19:15.760 --> 19:19.000
dares to deceive me,
abandon me, and humiliate me.

19:26.560 --> 19:28.880
Don't even think about leaving
if you don't give me

19:28.960 --> 19:29.800
an explanation.

19:29.880 --> 19:30.880
Fine.

19:34.600 --> 19:36.760
You want an explanation.
I will give you one.

19:38.080 --> 19:40.920
There are three things
I don't value in taking a wife.

19:41.000 --> 19:44.320
First, her family background.

19:44.400 --> 19:46.880
Second, the dowry she offers.

19:47.480 --> 19:50.120
Third, her looks and talents.

19:50.960 --> 19:53.040
I come from a humble background,

19:53.120 --> 19:57.600
living a tough life alone
with my widowed mother for 20 years.

19:57.680 --> 19:59.080
Others won't understand that.

19:59.680 --> 20:01.400
Daughters of officials and rich merchants

20:01.480 --> 20:03.320
are mostly arrogant and spoiled.

20:03.400 --> 20:07.600
Can they treat my elderly poor mother
with kindness and respect?

20:07.680 --> 20:08.600
No, they can't.

20:09.360 --> 20:11.480
Even if your wealth
rivals that of Shi Chong

20:11.560 --> 20:13.720
and you are as beautiful as a fairy,

20:15.080 --> 20:16.800
you're not the "Meng Guang" I seek.

20:18.680 --> 20:20.040
Fan Lianghan.

20:21.240 --> 20:22.280
Fan Lianghan.

20:22.840 --> 20:25.160
There is no one in there.

20:25.240 --> 20:26.200
Oh no.

20:26.760 --> 20:27.640
Why is she back?

20:27.720 --> 20:29.400
- If she sees us like this…
- Fan Lianghan.

20:29.480 --> 20:31.680
- …I'll have to marry you.
- Where are you?

20:32.320 --> 20:34.040
Master Fan is way too useless.

20:37.440 --> 20:39.840
Are they in there? Step aside.

20:39.920 --> 20:41.880
No, there's no one inside.

20:45.520 --> 20:47.560
Fan Lianghan.

20:47.640 --> 20:48.760
Come out.

20:49.280 --> 20:50.200
- Fan Lianghan.
- My lady.

20:50.280 --> 20:53.400
My lady, I swear there's no one inside.

20:53.480 --> 20:55.400
No one? Then who is she?

20:56.000 --> 20:58.040
Do you take me for a blind or a fool?

20:58.120 --> 20:59.160
How dare you fool me?

21:00.080 --> 21:01.960
Fan Lianghan, you'd better come out now.

21:02.040 --> 21:04.160
It will be worse for you if I catch you.

21:04.240 --> 21:06.680
I'll open the door
and tell her everything.

21:06.760 --> 21:07.880
Liu Baniang.

21:08.400 --> 21:10.600
Who asked Master Fan

21:10.680 --> 21:12.400
to invite me over to paint?

21:12.480 --> 21:13.320
Well…

21:14.800 --> 21:16.000
Still not coming out?

21:16.080 --> 21:17.400
Do I have to search in person?

21:20.240 --> 21:23.480
Fan Lianghan, come out.

21:26.520 --> 21:27.680
Fan Lianghan.

21:29.040 --> 21:30.240
Are you coming out or not?

21:31.640 --> 21:34.160
Fan Lianghan, I'll count to three.

21:35.000 --> 21:36.200
Hide. Go.

21:36.280 --> 21:37.840
- Hurry.
- Fan Lianghan.

21:38.520 --> 21:39.640
Hurry.

21:39.720 --> 21:41.440
Get in.

21:41.520 --> 21:42.560
I have a clear conscience.

21:42.640 --> 21:43.920
- Why should I hide?
- Fan Lianghan.

21:44.000 --> 21:45.840
Please do this for me.
I'm begging you. Get in.

21:45.920 --> 21:48.520
Open up, Fan Lianghan.

21:48.600 --> 21:49.880
Get in.

21:51.880 --> 21:53.040
Yuanming, suit yourself.

21:53.120 --> 21:56.640
Fan Lianghan, open up.

21:56.720 --> 21:57.720
Mr. Chai, what a surprise.

21:59.360 --> 22:01.360
- Fan Lianghan.
- I know what to do.

22:01.440 --> 22:03.120
Okay.

22:03.200 --> 22:04.200
Fan Lianghan.

22:08.480 --> 22:10.240
I know you're in there.

22:11.960 --> 22:12.920
Open up.

22:14.520 --> 22:15.720
Open up.

22:30.440 --> 22:32.320
My lady, he jumped out the window.

22:33.800 --> 22:35.640
- Useless.
- Useless.

22:40.200 --> 22:41.920
Fuhui, please calm down.

22:44.920 --> 22:46.720
Fuhui, there's a reason for this.

22:46.800 --> 22:48.200
It's my fault. Don't blame him.

22:48.280 --> 22:49.560
Find him first.

22:49.640 --> 22:50.480
Have a proper talk.

22:50.560 --> 22:51.480
You'll figure it out.

22:57.280 --> 22:58.160
Yuanming.

22:59.280 --> 23:00.120
Yuanming.

23:03.880 --> 23:04.800
Mr. Chai.

23:05.360 --> 23:06.600
What you did

23:06.680 --> 23:07.680
was really not honorable.

23:07.760 --> 23:10.440
Yuanming, the Chai and Liu families
have long been friends.

23:10.520 --> 23:11.720
And Baniang begged me for help.

23:11.800 --> 23:13.280
I had no choice.

23:13.360 --> 23:14.760
Please forgive me.

23:14.840 --> 23:18.520
I was hiding there
just in case Baniang acted on a whim.

23:18.600 --> 23:20.640
I'm really sorry that we disturbed you.

23:20.720 --> 23:22.440
I will apologize to you formally.

23:23.440 --> 23:24.280
Housekeeper.

23:24.360 --> 23:26.120
Before Fuhui comes back,

23:26.200 --> 23:27.680
hurry up and leave.

23:27.760 --> 23:30.120
- Escort Master Du out.
- Master Du, please.

23:30.200 --> 23:31.120
Yuanming, hurry.

23:40.560 --> 23:41.840
You set me up.

23:41.920 --> 23:43.320
It was such a mess.

23:43.400 --> 23:45.440
You owe me an explanation.

23:45.520 --> 23:46.680
Baniang.

23:46.760 --> 23:48.600
I did all this
to let you talk to Master Du.

23:48.680 --> 23:50.240
You've misunderstood me.

23:50.320 --> 23:51.680
Let's discuss the details later.

23:51.760 --> 23:53.200
Go home first. Hurry.

24:07.920 --> 24:09.160
- I'm dead.
- Master.

24:09.240 --> 24:10.280
I'm dead.

24:11.000 --> 24:13.600
Master, don't be afraid. It's me.

24:13.680 --> 24:15.560
Those two have left.

24:15.640 --> 24:17.320
My lady can't catch them.

24:18.920 --> 24:20.600
That's good.

24:22.520 --> 24:24.200
Who said I was hiding from her?

24:24.280 --> 24:25.520
Why should I be scared?

24:25.600 --> 24:27.440
Even if she is standing right here,

24:27.520 --> 24:28.520
I will…

24:29.160 --> 24:30.040
What will you do?

24:33.240 --> 24:34.760
I made a silly mistake.

24:34.840 --> 24:36.600
As long as I get on my knees and repent,

24:36.680 --> 24:40.040
how can my sweetheart scold me or hit me?

24:40.120 --> 24:42.400
Am I right, honey?

24:42.920 --> 24:44.720
Get up.

24:45.480 --> 24:46.720
Get up.

24:49.080 --> 24:51.040
- You may leave.
- Understood.

24:55.360 --> 24:56.920
Fuhui.

24:57.000 --> 24:58.960
My brother asked me to do this.

24:59.040 --> 25:01.320
Du Yangxi turned down
Liu Baniang for no reason.

25:01.400 --> 25:04.760
She felt humiliated
and insisted on confronting him.

25:04.840 --> 25:06.480
My brother made me do this.

25:07.680 --> 25:08.680
Look at you.

25:08.760 --> 25:11.680
You make it so much worse by saying that.

25:12.320 --> 25:14.480
You did everything
your brother told you to do.

25:14.560 --> 25:16.240
Don't you know that my mother wants

25:16.320 --> 25:17.960
Du Yangxi to marry into our family?

25:18.040 --> 25:20.200
Have you thought about Kangning?

25:20.280 --> 25:24.280
You always listen to your brother
and never care about me.

25:24.360 --> 25:26.400
How dare you keep me in the dark?

25:27.600 --> 25:29.280
Come here.

25:29.360 --> 25:30.640
Ouch, honey.

25:30.720 --> 25:33.720
Be gentle, honey. It hurts.

25:34.320 --> 25:35.240
Kangning.

25:35.320 --> 25:38.120
What Du Yangxi said might sound sincere,

25:38.200 --> 25:39.600
but it's not completely true.

25:39.680 --> 25:41.000
Ladies from wealthy families

25:41.080 --> 25:43.600
can also uphold filial piety
and moral principles.

25:44.200 --> 25:47.560
I bet he only wants someone
from a poor family for other reasons.

25:47.640 --> 25:50.480
He may fool Liu Baniang,
but he can't fool you.

25:50.560 --> 25:52.280
Your evaluation of Master Du

25:52.360 --> 25:54.680
is entirely speculative
without any solid evidence.

25:55.440 --> 25:57.200
Besides, everyone has their own destiny.

25:57.280 --> 26:00.600
It has nothing to do with him
that we're no longer engaged.

26:00.680 --> 26:01.640
Leave him alone.

26:01.720 --> 26:03.520
It has everything to do with him.

26:03.600 --> 26:05.080
Kangning, you promised to marry me.

26:05.680 --> 26:08.240
You keep pestering me,
unwilling to give up,

26:08.320 --> 26:10.920
merely out of pride
and your reluctance to admit defeat.

26:11.000 --> 26:11.880
You have your pride.

26:11.960 --> 26:13.160
I have my integrity.

26:13.760 --> 26:14.880
I suggest you let be it.

26:14.960 --> 26:16.120
Don't hold on to it.

26:17.280 --> 26:19.720
If he was a nice guy, I would let go.

26:19.800 --> 26:21.920
But judging from what he said and did,

26:22.000 --> 26:24.120
he clearly has ulterior motives.

26:24.200 --> 26:25.920
You can't entrust yourself to him.

26:26.520 --> 26:27.720
No way.

26:27.800 --> 26:28.680
I won't allow it.

26:28.760 --> 26:30.600
Go back. I know what to do.

26:30.680 --> 26:32.720
- Go. Hurry.
- Chai An.

26:33.400 --> 26:36.560
Chai An, since when did you
get to decide my marriage?

26:36.640 --> 26:37.680
Hurry up.

26:37.760 --> 26:39.080
You're too bossy.

26:39.640 --> 26:40.640
Chai An.

26:40.720 --> 26:41.960
Take her home.

27:01.720 --> 27:02.760
Did he really say that?

27:02.840 --> 27:05.520
Judging someone's character
in just a few words

27:05.600 --> 27:07.320
is truly absurd.

27:07.400 --> 27:08.920
Who knows if he's jealous

27:09.000 --> 27:12.400
and trying to destroy your marriage
with some lies?

27:12.480 --> 27:15.000
Master Chai is not that kind of person.

27:16.360 --> 27:19.480
But those two have been living next door
for a long time.

27:19.560 --> 27:22.240
Shouhua, you've read his poems and essays.

27:22.320 --> 27:25.760
Didn't you praise him for his insight
and talent?

27:25.840 --> 27:29.800
You even imitate his writing
because it conceals vigor and spirit.

27:30.400 --> 27:33.360
Even if they are bandits or criminals,

27:33.440 --> 27:35.160
we have neither wealth nor power.

27:35.240 --> 27:37.440
What would they want from us?

27:38.720 --> 27:40.480
Kangning, what do you say?

27:40.560 --> 27:43.560
I can't see through this person.

27:43.640 --> 27:46.440
But it doesn't have to be him.
Isn't there another candidate?

27:47.760 --> 27:48.920
No way.

27:49.000 --> 27:52.120
Forget about it. It won't work.

28:08.360 --> 28:09.360
What hair oil do you use?

28:10.600 --> 28:11.640
I…

28:16.440 --> 28:18.880
Top-quality osmanthus hair oil.

28:19.880 --> 28:21.960
That was the first time I saw a man

28:22.040 --> 28:24.600
throwing up due to the smell of hair oil.

28:24.680 --> 28:26.920
He deserves to remain single forever.

28:29.200 --> 28:31.840
Don't tell anyone about
what happened with Master Du yet.

28:31.920 --> 28:33.160
Don't tell our mother either.

28:33.240 --> 28:35.200
Time reveals people's hearts.

28:35.280 --> 28:38.280
If there is something wrong with him,
we'll find out about it.

28:38.360 --> 28:39.440
Let's wait a bit.

28:43.760 --> 28:46.040
Your mother and I are best friends.

28:46.760 --> 28:47.840
You would follow her here

28:47.920 --> 28:51.920
when you were a kid and run behind An'er.

28:53.120 --> 28:54.400
I haven't seen you for years.

28:54.480 --> 28:57.200
You've grown into such a stunning beauty.

28:57.280 --> 28:59.320
So dazzling.

29:00.080 --> 29:03.600
I heard you often traveled
with your father.

29:04.360 --> 29:05.400
He is so muddle-headed.

29:05.480 --> 29:08.640
How can he let you run around in public
in the prime of youth?

29:09.760 --> 29:12.400
Now, Chai An has grown up.

29:12.480 --> 29:14.280
Your mother mentioned it to me yesterday.

29:16.760 --> 29:18.520
Fine, I'll stop right here.

29:18.600 --> 29:21.000
I'll discuss it with your mother.

29:22.000 --> 29:23.640
Madam, the young master is back.

29:23.720 --> 29:24.960
Mother.

29:25.040 --> 29:27.000
An'er, you've come back just in time.

29:27.080 --> 29:29.280
Sit with Baniang.

29:29.360 --> 29:31.600
The servants don't know
what Baniang likes.

29:31.680 --> 29:34.320
I will tell them what snacks to get.

29:34.400 --> 29:36.280
Don't bother, Mother. Let me do it.

29:36.920 --> 29:38.800
Let me do it.

29:39.840 --> 29:43.240
You grew up together
like siblings. Don't be shy.

29:44.880 --> 29:47.240
- Mother.
- Sit down.

29:52.360 --> 29:53.400
Deqing.

30:11.200 --> 30:13.600
Chai An, you said you would do me justice,

30:13.680 --> 30:15.640
but in fact, you served your own purpose.

30:16.320 --> 30:19.960
Du Yangxi outright refused you,
which made you upset for a long time.

30:20.040 --> 30:22.720
You insisted on seeing him,
so I helped out.

30:23.600 --> 30:25.320
I just brought along another onlooker,

30:25.400 --> 30:27.120
but I helped you,
so you have to help me too.

30:27.200 --> 30:29.960
You're always straightforward.
Why do you mind it?

30:30.560 --> 30:31.440
You…

30:34.040 --> 30:36.720
You're really going to lengths
for Li Kangning.

30:37.680 --> 30:38.840
But I can tell

30:39.480 --> 30:42.000
that your mother wants me
as her daughter-in-law.

30:42.080 --> 30:45.920
I'm afraid all your efforts
have been in vain.

30:48.080 --> 30:49.320
Baniang.

30:50.280 --> 30:52.600
You've seen the painting
and met him in person.

30:52.680 --> 30:56.480
Du Yangxi truly stands out
with his literary grace and charm.

30:58.680 --> 31:00.200
Aren't you any attracted?

31:04.760 --> 31:07.240
My marriage is entirely up to my parents.

31:08.120 --> 31:10.720
I'm just a young lady.
I have no say in this matter.

31:11.320 --> 31:13.520
- Alright then, forget it.
- Chai An.

31:15.360 --> 31:16.600
You have an idea?

31:17.920 --> 31:20.280
This man is quite elusive.

31:21.240 --> 31:24.000
But we're not a powerless
ordinary family in Bianjing.

31:24.520 --> 31:27.360
Even if he has a thousand tricks,
I can deal with them.

31:27.440 --> 31:29.120
What is there to fear?

31:29.200 --> 31:32.840
But your mother wants
a marital alliance so badly.

31:32.920 --> 31:34.080
How is Du Yangxi…

31:35.880 --> 31:39.520
As long as you follow my plan,
within ten days,

31:39.600 --> 31:40.920
my mother will change her mind.

31:41.000 --> 31:43.520
Even Master Du will turn to pursue you.

31:44.160 --> 31:45.840
- Deal.
- Deal.

31:50.640 --> 31:52.600
PAN RESTAURANT

31:52.680 --> 31:55.480
- This is infuriating. That diviner!
- Sister.

31:55.560 --> 31:57.040
It was just a divination.

31:57.120 --> 31:58.560
Why did you get enraged?

31:58.640 --> 32:00.200
Mr. Wang, the diviner,

32:00.280 --> 32:02.080
said that the Chai and Liu families

32:02.160 --> 32:03.800
couldn't form a marital alliance.

32:03.880 --> 32:07.760
And he dared to curse my son
with a life of solitude.

32:07.840 --> 32:09.680
I was magnanimous
for not smashing his things

32:09.760 --> 32:11.000
on the spot.

32:11.800 --> 32:13.520
But he read your fortune

32:13.600 --> 32:16.560
and wrote down what had happened to you.

32:16.640 --> 32:18.880
Everything he wrote was accurate.

32:19.520 --> 32:21.320
I bet he learned those from Lianghan.

32:22.320 --> 32:25.440
Even your son doesn't know
that you went missing when you were six

32:25.520 --> 32:27.320
and were found later.

32:27.400 --> 32:28.480
How can the diviner cheat?

32:29.080 --> 32:30.200
He's just wrong.

32:30.760 --> 32:34.520
No one can ruin the marriage
between my son and Liu Baniang.

32:34.600 --> 32:36.160
I must try someone else.

32:40.280 --> 32:41.440
Madam.

32:41.520 --> 32:42.560
Has Lady Liu arrived?

32:42.640 --> 32:43.560
The Liu family said

32:43.640 --> 32:47.200
that the shaft of Lady Liu's carriage
broke right after she left home.

32:47.800 --> 32:49.360
Lady Liu thought it was a bad sign,

32:49.440 --> 32:52.040
so she headed back
and sent someone to apologize.

32:52.680 --> 32:54.440
What? It broke?

32:54.520 --> 32:55.840
You see?

32:56.520 --> 32:57.560
Madam, bad news.

33:00.560 --> 33:01.960
- An'er.
- Mother.

33:02.040 --> 33:03.840
An'er, what's happened?

33:04.840 --> 33:05.680
How did you get hurt?

33:05.760 --> 33:07.080
I was coming back from work.

33:07.160 --> 33:09.000
The horse went crazy
and started running wild

33:09.080 --> 33:09.960
for no reason.

33:10.040 --> 33:11.920
Thankfully, no one else was hurt.

33:12.000 --> 33:13.560
Mother, don't worry.

33:13.640 --> 33:14.520
It's nothing serious.

33:14.600 --> 33:16.720
Hurry. Apply some medicine.

33:16.800 --> 33:18.800
That's right. Hurry up.

33:18.880 --> 33:21.000
- Find a physician.
- Understood.

33:30.760 --> 33:32.600
I hope you do not take offense.

33:32.680 --> 33:34.960
Your son is afflicted by the Lonely Star.

33:35.040 --> 33:36.080
His marital fate suffers.

33:36.160 --> 33:38.680
Even if you find him a wife,

33:38.760 --> 33:41.560
in as little as one month
or half a year tops,

33:41.640 --> 33:43.520
a calamity will surely befall.

33:43.600 --> 33:45.480
There will be blood.

33:46.120 --> 33:49.080
There was someone
with great energy in her fortune

33:49.160 --> 33:51.240
that could suppress his Lonely Star.

33:51.320 --> 33:54.440
It's a pity
that the marital tie was severed

33:54.520 --> 33:55.640
before it was formed.

33:56.240 --> 33:59.680
It's both timing and fate.

34:00.680 --> 34:01.640
Oh no.

34:02.560 --> 34:05.680
I shouldn't have canceled the engagement.

34:14.080 --> 34:17.160
You are truly ruthless.
How did you manage to do this?

34:17.760 --> 34:19.680
The wound looks terrifying.

34:23.160 --> 34:25.120
Madam watched
the physician give a prescription

34:25.200 --> 34:26.440
and left in a hurry.

34:26.520 --> 34:28.080
We don't know where she went.

34:28.160 --> 34:29.440
I know where she went.

34:31.000 --> 34:33.840
Any news from the people I sent to Ezhou?

34:33.920 --> 34:35.000
A message has come.

34:35.080 --> 34:37.520
The person was found and put on a boat.

34:41.520 --> 34:43.480
- Do not come again.
- Madam Li.

34:43.560 --> 34:44.800
- Madam Li.
- Go away.

34:44.880 --> 34:46.360
- Madam Li.
- Get out.

34:46.960 --> 34:48.520
Take these back.

34:49.760 --> 34:52.000
The Chai family is wealthy
and influential,

34:52.080 --> 34:54.000
with good farmland and great business.

34:54.080 --> 34:55.760
Their wealth and honor are unmatched.

34:55.840 --> 34:59.640
My family only runs a small tea stall
with one storefront.

34:59.720 --> 35:02.040
We're no match for them in social status.

35:02.680 --> 35:06.560
The son of the Chai family
is the best young man in the world.

35:06.640 --> 35:08.240
He's one of a kind.

35:08.320 --> 35:11.200
But my daughter is just a village girl

35:11.280 --> 35:13.760
who lacks proper upbringing and manners.

35:13.840 --> 35:16.000
She's no match for that young man.

35:16.080 --> 35:17.400
Whoever wants to cling

35:18.000 --> 35:20.200
to this wealthy and powerful family,
go ahead.

35:20.280 --> 35:22.120
Even if they come begging me,

35:22.200 --> 35:24.120
- I won't bother seeing them.
- Madam Li.

35:24.720 --> 35:27.680
Madam Chai deeply regrets her decision.

35:27.760 --> 35:29.600
She has long changed her mind.

35:29.680 --> 35:31.600
So, she sent us here to apologize,

35:31.680 --> 35:35.840
hoping that
you'll overlook past grievances and renew

35:35.920 --> 35:37.920
the marital tie between the two families.

35:38.000 --> 35:40.040
She is totally sincere.

35:40.120 --> 35:43.480
Such nice in-laws are hard to find.

35:43.560 --> 35:45.160
Even if you are holding a grudge,

35:45.240 --> 35:47.880
you should think about your daughter.

35:47.960 --> 35:49.560
Yeah, take a look.

35:49.640 --> 35:51.360
These are all good stuff.

35:53.080 --> 35:54.280
Good stuff?

35:54.920 --> 35:56.240
Good stuff?

35:56.320 --> 35:57.920
What good stuff?

35:58.000 --> 36:00.960
They despise the poor
and admire the rich.

36:01.040 --> 36:02.640
They're the worst of the worst.

36:02.720 --> 36:03.920
The worst.

36:04.000 --> 36:05.840
When I marry off my daughter,

36:06.440 --> 36:08.800
I won't care about status or wealth.

36:08.880 --> 36:11.880
I will find her a good family
valuing education and integrity.

36:11.960 --> 36:15.240
The Chai family came back
to ask for my daughter?

36:15.880 --> 36:17.440
In their dreams!

36:17.520 --> 36:18.640
Go away.

36:19.880 --> 36:20.920
Take it away!

36:21.640 --> 36:22.840
Go away.

36:23.360 --> 36:24.600
Madam Li.

36:24.680 --> 36:25.520
Madam Li.

36:26.360 --> 36:28.280
- Madam Li.
- If you dare to come again,

36:28.360 --> 36:30.600
I'll kick you out! Close the door.

36:31.480 --> 36:32.480
Madam Li.

36:32.560 --> 36:34.280
Madam Li. Open up.

36:34.360 --> 36:35.560
Why did they close the door?

36:35.640 --> 36:37.960
- Madam Li.
- Madam Li.

36:41.880 --> 36:45.160
You always outshine bright colors.
Beautiful.

36:45.240 --> 36:47.560
Your goose-yellow gown is also pretty.

36:47.640 --> 36:49.160
It looks cheerful in winter.

36:50.160 --> 36:51.360
But the waist is a bit loose.

36:51.440 --> 36:54.400
Mother wants to fill the quilts
with new cotton for our neighbors.

36:54.480 --> 36:55.880
I was too busy to modify my clothes.

36:56.880 --> 36:58.440
Give it to me. I'll help.

36:59.120 --> 37:01.480
Just don't get your hair oil on it.

37:01.560 --> 37:03.760
Or someone may end up puking in his sleep.

37:03.840 --> 37:05.200
That's going to be tiring.

37:05.760 --> 37:07.960
The Chai family came back
to ask for my daughter?

37:08.040 --> 37:09.240
In their dreams!

37:09.320 --> 37:11.040
Close the door. Get lost.

37:12.520 --> 37:16.000
Shouhua, I only improvised the "get lost".

37:16.080 --> 37:17.200
The rest are her exact words.

37:23.560 --> 37:25.000
Why didn't you pay attention?

37:25.080 --> 37:28.040
You didn't see
our mother's awe-inspiring stance.

37:28.120 --> 37:29.160
So imposing.

37:29.840 --> 37:30.800
They deserve it.

37:31.320 --> 37:33.520
Why did the Chai family
put on air and bully us

37:34.640 --> 37:35.680
in the beginning?

37:37.920 --> 37:41.480
He first invited Kangning to eavesdrop
and made Madam Chai change her mind.

37:42.120 --> 37:44.360
Master Chai seems determined

37:44.440 --> 37:46.760
to win Kangning back at all costs.

37:47.680 --> 37:51.680
But it's not easy to change the mindset
of disdaining the poor.

37:52.280 --> 37:55.320
If Madam Chai
changes her mind again one day,

37:55.400 --> 37:57.240
then our family
will be utterly humiliated.

37:58.560 --> 38:00.480
Mr. Chai is so used
to calling the shots alone.

38:00.560 --> 38:03.920
He decides to get engaged and back out
whenever he wants,

38:04.600 --> 38:06.960
treating me like his pet or toy,

38:07.040 --> 38:08.000
who doesn't have a say.

38:09.600 --> 38:12.080
I will decide whom to marry.

38:12.160 --> 38:15.640
If he insists on meddling,
then I won't let him off.

38:19.760 --> 38:21.320
You've seen the fanciest accessories.

38:21.400 --> 38:23.440
I wouldn't dare offer anything ordinary.

38:23.520 --> 38:26.680
I handpicked the special ones
just for you.

38:27.280 --> 38:29.880
This cloisonné flower tube hairpin
may seem simple,

38:29.960 --> 38:32.400
but the flare is great
for holding flowers.

38:36.800 --> 38:37.640
You…

38:43.040 --> 38:46.200
We've received so many proposals
from Bianjing,

38:46.280 --> 38:47.920
even to the Daming prefecture.

38:48.000 --> 38:49.280
I'm so swamped.

38:50.120 --> 38:51.640
Here are their birthdays.

38:51.720 --> 38:54.600
Please take a look and find the best fit.

39:07.280 --> 39:08.120
Madam.

39:10.320 --> 39:12.560
XINHAI JIAXU YISI GUISI

39:12.640 --> 39:14.240
Li Kangning. I knew it.

39:14.320 --> 39:15.480
It is the will of heaven.

39:15.560 --> 39:18.040
Even the parents shall not resist it.

39:18.120 --> 39:19.720
If you don't take my advice…

39:20.520 --> 39:24.000
What if I don't take your advice?

39:27.560 --> 39:29.760
- Turn this upside down.
- Wait.

39:29.840 --> 39:31.360
Please don't.

39:33.440 --> 39:34.480
- Capture him.
- Please don't.

39:35.560 --> 39:37.880
I tested you to see if you were authentic.

39:37.960 --> 39:40.160
You wrote a few lines
and dropped the paper.

39:40.240 --> 39:41.560
Then you asked me about my past.

39:41.640 --> 39:43.600
Even if you didn't get anything right,

39:43.680 --> 39:45.400
the boy under the table would fix it.

39:45.480 --> 39:46.840
How could it not be accurate?

39:46.920 --> 39:48.720
It's nothing but a lie!

39:49.320 --> 39:50.240
Madam Chai.

39:50.320 --> 39:51.680
Master Chai orchestrated this.

39:51.760 --> 39:53.600
I just did what he told me to do.

39:53.680 --> 39:54.920
My lady, please spare me.

39:55.000 --> 39:56.840
Madam Chai, please spare me.

39:56.920 --> 39:59.000
FINE WINE PRODUCED BY PAN RESTAURANT

39:59.080 --> 40:01.080
DELICACIES AND TOP QUALITY DRINKS

40:01.160 --> 40:02.160
Master.

40:02.240 --> 40:03.680
Gentlemen, please come in.

40:05.480 --> 40:06.520
I see.

40:06.600 --> 40:08.280
Bring the horse. I'm going to the port.

40:09.200 --> 40:10.520
Hurry up.

40:10.600 --> 40:12.640
But what about Madam?

40:12.720 --> 40:13.560
Let her be.

40:25.840 --> 40:27.640
Master.

40:29.040 --> 40:32.200
Master, I rushed to the port
as you ordered, but nobody was there.

40:32.280 --> 40:33.600
You didn't find her?

40:33.680 --> 40:34.560
What about the guards?

40:34.640 --> 40:37.480
Liu's merchant ship
should have arrived by midday,

40:37.560 --> 40:39.240
but I saw no trace of the ship.

40:39.840 --> 40:41.280
I didn't want to keep you waiting,

40:41.360 --> 40:44.080
so I told the others to stay
and came back alone.

40:45.280 --> 40:46.120
Oh no.

40:59.080 --> 41:00.000
Liu Baniang.

41:00.080 --> 41:01.760
Why did you go back on your word?

41:01.840 --> 41:03.160
You agreed to my plan.

41:03.240 --> 41:04.760
Yet you sold me out.

41:05.360 --> 41:06.400
What makes you say that?

41:06.480 --> 41:08.840
The diviner has been in this profession
for over a decade

41:08.920 --> 41:10.480
and rarely slips up.

41:10.560 --> 41:12.080
But my mother saw through his tricks.

41:12.160 --> 41:14.600
Before that, she had been
scammed out of a fortune every year.

41:15.520 --> 41:18.120
The person I found should have arrived
but vanished.

41:18.200 --> 41:20.840
And it just happened
that they boarded your merchant ship.

41:20.920 --> 41:23.400
Liu Baniang. Tell me. Where is she?

41:24.040 --> 41:25.600
Chai An.

41:25.680 --> 41:28.520
Sorry, I have let you down.

41:30.560 --> 41:31.720
She's with the Li family?

41:37.080 --> 41:39.880
- Welcome our guest.
- Understood.

41:44.240 --> 41:46.040
Madam Du, please step out of the sedan.

42:12.400 --> 42:15.360
Master Du is good-looking,
graceful, and elegant.

42:16.200 --> 42:19.200
How come his mother looks like this?

42:19.280 --> 42:21.600
Haode, why do you sound so judgmental?

42:21.680 --> 42:22.800
That's not what I meant.

42:25.920 --> 42:28.960
They don't look alike.

42:29.040 --> 42:30.200
MADAM DU

42:30.280 --> 42:32.160
She doesn't look like his mother.

42:32.240 --> 42:34.080
She's more like his grandmother.

42:36.160 --> 42:37.560
Let's go.

42:46.160 --> 42:48.160
Sister, here.

42:48.240 --> 42:49.680
Please enjoy.

42:49.760 --> 42:52.800
You're too kind. How do I deserve this?

42:53.760 --> 42:54.680
Here's the spoon.

42:55.800 --> 42:57.280
Be careful. It's hot.

43:39.360 --> 43:41.160
Good girl.

43:42.480 --> 43:43.600
Thank you.

43:51.720 --> 43:52.960
What did Li Kangning offer you?

43:53.960 --> 43:55.440
She told me…

43:55.520 --> 43:58.960
If you marry Master Du,
even if he passes the exam

43:59.040 --> 44:01.480
and gets appointed to the Hanlin Academy
or to an external post,

44:01.560 --> 44:03.920
his salary will be meager,
and you'll live a modest life.

44:05.040 --> 44:07.640
It may be fine to use up your dowry,

44:07.720 --> 44:09.920
but you may have to imitate
Meng Guang from ancient times,

44:10.000 --> 44:11.400
remove all the accessories,

44:12.000 --> 44:13.360
change into worn-out clothes,

44:13.960 --> 44:15.480
and look after your mother-in-law.

44:15.560 --> 44:18.480
How can a single young lady
say such things?

44:19.720 --> 44:22.560
Merchants value profit over anything else.

44:23.280 --> 44:25.040
I can't say such things to the others.

44:25.600 --> 44:26.440
But I can to you.

44:32.800 --> 44:34.480
But I can't marry Chai An either.

44:35.040 --> 44:36.760
He is so shrewd.

44:36.840 --> 44:39.680
I won't be able
to take any advantage of him.

44:40.360 --> 44:43.440
Except for scholars and cunning merchants,

44:43.520 --> 44:44.800
don't you have other options?

44:47.880 --> 44:50.600
She changed your mind
with just a few words?

44:50.680 --> 44:51.840
I don't believe it.

44:51.920 --> 44:52.800
Who did she recommend?

44:53.680 --> 44:55.520
All my elder sisters are married.

44:55.600 --> 44:56.840
My younger brother is only nine.

44:57.440 --> 45:01.000
I'll get a lot more
if someone marries into my family.

45:01.080 --> 45:03.120
Thankfully, Kangning reminded me.

45:03.200 --> 45:05.040
I didn't see the whole picture.

45:06.920 --> 45:09.080
The problem is you won't make it.

45:09.160 --> 45:12.040
Let's see whether she teaches you
how to convince your father

45:12.120 --> 45:13.640
to keep you at home.

45:14.960 --> 45:16.720
My dear brother.

45:16.800 --> 45:20.120
Merchants often pursue profit
over righteousness.

45:20.200 --> 45:23.000
I grew up observing what the merchants do

45:23.080 --> 45:26.560
and learned to be
obsessed with wealth better than anyone.

45:26.640 --> 45:28.520
It's not that I want to betray you.

45:28.600 --> 45:30.160
It's really just my nature.

45:30.960 --> 45:32.800
Whoever offers me the most benefits,

45:32.880 --> 45:36.720
I will naturally follow their lead
without any second thoughts.

45:37.320 --> 45:38.920
Well played, Li Kangning.

45:39.440 --> 45:41.760
How dare you stab me in my back?

45:42.520 --> 45:43.760
Despicable.

45:44.480 --> 45:45.360
So despicable.

45:46.560 --> 45:47.600
Chai An?

45:48.160 --> 45:49.360
Chai An!

48:17.440 --> 48:19.360
Subtitle translation by: Jie Chen
